/-! # Staged checks of `examples/dyn/pinned/hello-gcc`

Every theorem is one leaf (`Silmaril.Elf.Staged.Leaf`) run in the kernel on the 4 KiB pages
of the file (`Leaf.of_kernel`, `decide +kernel`) (generated by `elf-staged emit-example` from examples/dyn/pinned/hello-gcc, 15960 bytes). Under an acceleration
policy the same leaves run natively (`Leaf.of_native`) and conclude the same propositions. -/

@[expose] public section

namespace Silmaril.Elf.Staged.Example

